1
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,347
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,372 --> 00:00:27,874
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,268 --> 00:00:30,609
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,634 --> 00:00:35,366
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,497 --> 00:00:38,755
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,008 --> 00:00:42,699
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,518 --> 00:00:48,290
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,205 --> 00:00:55,734
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:58,511
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,523 --> 00:00:59,521
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,052 --> 00:01:04,114
=Episode 6=

12
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,740
Dear,

13
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:09,579
you're really okay
letting Weiyue treat her?

14
00:01:09,619 --> 00:01:11,380
It might end with both mother and child
dead.

15
00:01:11,579 --> 00:01:12,059
Exactly.

16
00:01:12,499 --> 00:01:14,619
And Yuya actually believed her nonsense

17
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:15,700
and cleared everyone out for her.

18
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,099
Prince of Rong has stepped in.

19
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:18,459
What can I do?

20
00:01:23,579 --> 00:01:25,220
I helped you this time.

21
00:01:25,499 --> 00:01:26,939
Whether you save her...

22
00:01:29,099 --> 00:01:30,260
Or she dies...

23
00:01:33,419 --> 00:01:34,979
You're coming back with me.

24
00:01:34,979 --> 00:01:37,380
Alright, sure. I'll go back with you
when I'm done.

25
00:01:38,059 --> 00:01:39,340
Thanks.

26
00:01:43,979 --> 00:01:45,019
What is this?

27
00:01:45,139 --> 00:01:47,139
This is an IV bottle.

28
00:01:47,939 --> 00:01:49,180
Give it here first.

29
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:51,539
And this?

30
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:53,099
This is an IV tube.

31
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:53,939
Oh, Your Highness,

32
00:01:53,979 --> 00:01:55,380
just go sit over there for a while.

33
00:01:55,459 --> 00:01:57,099
I'm not used to this anyway.

34
00:02:01,419 --> 00:02:03,260
When did she conjure that up?

35
00:02:10,059 --> 00:02:11,300
You can do acupuncture too?

36
00:02:12,419 --> 00:02:13,579
Tear this for me.

37
00:02:22,780 --> 00:02:24,459
Isn't this a thumb ring?

38
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,380
Alright now, give it to me.

39
00:03:07,059 --> 00:03:09,059
How is she, Weiyue?

40
00:03:09,619 --> 00:03:10,900
She's out of danger.

41
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:14,820
And is the child safe?

42
00:03:15,139 --> 00:03:16,419
Of course.

43
00:03:16,780 --> 00:03:19,419
But she shouldn't have visitors yet.

44
00:03:21,459 --> 00:03:22,180
For the next few days,

45
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:24,180
if you're short of anything,

46
00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:25,499
just give the order.

47
00:03:25,499 --> 00:03:27,499
I'll make sure everything is provided.

48
00:03:27,939 --> 00:03:28,619
That won't be necessary.

49
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:31,979
Just keep irrelevant people
like Madam An and my sister

50
00:03:31,979 --> 00:03:33,900
from wandering around this courtyard.

51
00:03:34,579 --> 00:03:35,434
What do you mean?

52
00:03:35,459 --> 00:03:36,499
Exactly that.

53
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:49,019
Thank you for your hard work.

54
00:03:49,419 --> 00:03:50,059
Your Highness,

55
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:51,820
I'll take my leave.

56
00:04:09,099 --> 00:04:10,300
What a wretch!

57
00:04:11,059 --> 00:04:12,820
That wretch is really tough.

58
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:15,380
Feng Weiyue actually saved her.

59
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:17,939
Mother, don't get upset.

60
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:19,619
She's just Madam Bai.

61
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:22,579
Silly child, if she gives birth
to a boy,

62
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:24,820
you'll have even less place
in this house.

63
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:25,419
No rush.

64
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:26,419
Mother,

65
00:04:26,619 --> 00:04:28,780
we can't act rashly now.

66
00:04:29,019 --> 00:04:30,820
It's a long time before she's due.

67
00:04:30,939 --> 00:04:32,459
Who knows what might happen

68
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:33,780
later on?

69
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:34,660
Like an accident.

70
00:04:44,059 --> 00:04:45,220
Greetings, Princess Consort.

71
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:46,180
Thanks for your hard work.

72
00:04:46,499 --> 00:04:47,340
Bye.

73
00:04:55,419 --> 00:04:58,059
I used up all the points from
the novice gift pack last night.

74
00:04:58,260 --> 00:05:00,139
I must have lost my mind

75
00:05:00,139 --> 00:05:01,979
when I set this thing up.

76
00:05:02,139 --> 00:05:03,780
If I'd known I'd end up
in this godforsaken place,

77
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:05,820
why would I set up a points system?

78
00:05:07,059 --> 00:05:09,139
Everything has to be exchanged
with points.

79
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,890
(Quest 1: Find the culprit behind
Madam Bai's miscarriage.)

80
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,061
(Accept random quests to earn points.
Confirm/Cancel)

81
00:05:15,086 --> 00:05:16,720
(Quest 1: Find the culprit
behind Madam Bai's miscarriage.)

82
00:05:16,721 --> 00:05:18,183
(Complete the minor punishment quest
to earn 100 points.)

83
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:20,539
I'm already in ancient times,

84
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:23,619
and this system is still doing
big data surveillance on me?

85
00:05:24,970 --> 00:05:28,736
(Grand Tutor's Residence)

86
00:05:29,139 --> 00:05:29,700
Hey!

87
00:05:29,979 --> 00:05:31,340
Mo Yuya, wait up!

88
00:05:37,099 --> 00:05:38,099
Feng Weiyue.

89
00:05:38,619 --> 00:05:40,139
What are you up to now?

90
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:43,139
You won't take my carriage back

91
00:05:43,459 --> 00:05:45,539
but insist on taking
your family's carriage?

92
00:05:47,059 --> 00:05:49,459
Your carriage is too flashy.

93
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:51,979
Your Highness, we should keep
a low profile.

94
00:05:52,579 --> 00:05:53,180
Flashy?

95
00:05:56,139 --> 00:05:59,860
Those three years you chased me
all over the streets,

96
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:02,380
why didn't you think of keeping
a low profile then?

97
00:06:04,939 --> 00:06:07,099
(Oh, right. The culprit.)

98
00:06:08,139 --> 00:06:10,939
(That vicious mother and daughter
must be involved.)

99
00:06:22,690 --> 00:06:24,435
(Grand Tutor's Residence)

100
00:06:24,459 --> 00:06:26,099
I'm so sorry. I deserve punishment.

101
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:27,780
I've had a lame hand and foot for years.

102
00:06:27,939 --> 00:06:29,340
I didn't expect the whip
to hit the horse

103
00:06:29,419 --> 00:06:30,459
and startle Your Highness
and the Princess Consort.

104
00:06:30,579 --> 00:06:32,260
Please spare my life,
Your Highness, Princess Consort.

105
00:06:33,579 --> 00:06:34,459
Spare me.

106
00:06:35,059 --> 00:06:36,539
Please spare me,
Your Highness, Princess Consort.

107
00:06:37,099 --> 00:06:38,459
It's all right. Get up first.

108
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:42,860
Please show mercy, Princess Consort.
Please.

109
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,059
(Smell of musk.)

110
00:06:44,059 --> 00:06:45,700
I'll go get another coachman for you
right away, Princess Consort.

111
00:06:46,939 --> 00:06:48,579
(I remember when I was giving Mother
an IV,)

112
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:51,579
(I smelled a faint scent of musk.)

113
00:06:54,459 --> 00:06:55,139
You may go.

114
00:06:57,183 --> 00:07:01,349
(Grand Tutor's Residence)

115
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:08,380
Your Highness, I found the culprit
who almost caused

116
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,619
my mother's miscarriage.

117
00:07:19,539 --> 00:07:21,180
Finally willing to come see me?

118
00:07:21,180 --> 00:07:23,260
Stop fooling around. This is serious.

119
00:07:29,579 --> 00:07:31,180
You can't even eavesdrop properly.

120
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:33,059
You ask me to help you

121
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:35,019
just to follow a coachman?

122
00:07:36,419 --> 00:07:39,220
I smelled musk on him just now.

123
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:41,459
What happened to Mother before,

124
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:43,459
he must be involved.

125
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:46,099
But he's just a discharged soldier.

126
00:07:46,499 --> 00:07:47,700
If he really is up to something

127
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:48,979
and I get caught,

128
00:07:49,099 --> 00:07:50,459
he'll kill me.

129
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:53,820
So I'm asking Your Highness
to protect me from the sidelines.

130
00:07:54,340 --> 00:07:54,900
You can fight one-handed.

131
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:55,820
The miscarriage

132
00:07:56,619 --> 00:07:57,900
has caused such a stir.

133
00:07:58,340 --> 00:08:00,260
Madam An is afraid it'll implicate her,

134
00:08:00,459 --> 00:08:01,780
so she told you to leave
as soon as possible.

135
00:08:02,019 --> 00:08:02,860
What's she afraid of?

136
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:05,139
Even if they find out it's musk,
so what?

137
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,099
I'm just a coachman.

138
00:08:06,300 --> 00:08:08,139
I get injuries from training horses
all the time.

139
00:08:08,286 --> 00:08:09,806
(Ma Zhen, Coachman)
Can't I use musk medicine?

140
00:08:10,619 --> 00:08:12,139
(Yuqin, Maid)
That's what I told Madam An too.

141
00:08:12,539 --> 00:08:14,499
But she's just afraid of the worst.

142
00:08:16,339 --> 00:08:17,379
Zhen,

143
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:18,900
I know how you feel.

144
00:08:19,099 --> 00:08:21,939
But our indenture contracts
are still with Madam An.

145
00:08:22,059 --> 00:08:22,660
We...

146
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:24,139
Madam An already promised me.

147
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:25,979
As long as I finish this,

148
00:08:26,179 --> 00:08:27,259
we can leave.

149
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:29,059
Hey, it's okay.

150
00:08:29,299 --> 00:08:31,179
We'll be free soon.

151
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:38,939
How dare you!

152
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,780
Carrying on an affair
in Grand Tutor's Residence?

153
00:08:42,219 --> 00:08:44,660
Grand Tutor's Residence strictly forbids
servants from secretly forming ties.

154
00:08:45,179 --> 00:08:48,460
You two actually developed feelings
in secret.

155
00:08:48,660 --> 00:08:49,979
I'll report this to Father

156
00:08:49,979 --> 00:08:51,620
and have you both given 80 strokes.

157
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:53,700
If you're still breathing after that,

158
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:55,460
I'll sell you to slave traders again.

159
00:08:56,099 --> 00:08:57,339
Please spare us, my lady.

160
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:58,660
Please show mercy, my lady.

161
00:08:59,219 --> 00:08:59,939
It was her.

162
00:09:00,219 --> 00:09:01,420
She seduced me on purpose.

163
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:03,139
That's why I lost my head for a moment.

164
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:04,660
This has nothing to do with me.

165
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:05,139
How could you...

166
00:09:05,299 --> 00:09:05,820
My lady,

167
00:09:06,019 --> 00:09:07,420
I've been loyal to the Feng family.

168
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:08,740
Then why did you do dirty deeds

169
00:09:08,939 --> 00:09:10,099
for Madam An?

170
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:12,379
I was wrong.

171
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,939
Madam An used our indenture contracts
to control us.

172
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:17,339
That's why...

173
00:09:17,339 --> 00:09:19,339
That's why I helped her get the musk.

174
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:21,420
My lady, I can help you testify
against Madam An.

175
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:23,339
Please spare me.

176
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:28,660
This is the man you thought you could
entrust your life to?

177
00:09:34,379 --> 00:09:35,099
Keep me.

178
00:09:35,299 --> 00:09:36,780
I can help you testify against Madam An.

179
00:09:37,219 --> 00:09:39,019
I'm Madam An's personal maid.

180
00:09:39,019 --> 00:09:41,900
My testimony will be far more convincing
than this coachman's.

181
00:09:43,019 --> 00:09:44,379
At least you're thinking clearly.

182
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:45,700
Not completely love-struck.

183
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:47,939
But you can't help me much.

184
00:09:48,379 --> 00:09:51,139
Madam An's orders
must all have been verbal.

185
00:09:51,420 --> 00:09:53,259
She wouldn't have left
any paper evidence.

186
00:09:53,620 --> 00:09:55,179
You're right.

187
00:09:55,420 --> 00:09:56,500
But my lady,

188
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:58,019
I can work for you.

189
00:09:58,259 --> 00:09:59,820
As long as you help me save my sister.

190
00:10:00,219 --> 00:10:01,740
My sister is in Madam An's hands.

191
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:03,780
That's why I've been doing
whatever she says.

192
00:10:03,939 --> 00:10:05,099
If you can help me,

193
00:10:05,259 --> 00:10:06,939
I'll serve you from now on.

194
00:10:07,979 --> 00:10:08,540
All right.

195
00:10:08,979 --> 00:10:09,939
I agree.

196
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,219
We never saw each other today.

197
00:10:12,219 --> 00:10:13,620
You were never here.

198
00:10:14,339 --> 00:10:15,460
You can go.

199
00:10:15,660 --> 00:10:16,979
Thank you, my lady.

200
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:20,620
My lady,

201
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:21,460
what about me?

202
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,019
I can serve you too.

203
00:10:23,019 --> 00:10:23,660
You?

204
00:10:25,259 --> 00:10:26,620
Go to hell, you scumbag!

205
00:10:32,139 --> 00:10:33,500
Get lost!

206
00:10:41,179 --> 00:10:42,740
I never would've guessed,

207
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,700
but you're quite good
at winning people over.

208
00:10:46,379 --> 00:10:47,700
Who are you really?

209
00:10:49,219 --> 00:10:50,740
I'm Feng Weiyue.

210
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:55,620
You're different from before.

211
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:58,740
The reason you think I've changed

212
00:10:59,179 --> 00:11:01,700
is that you never really looked at me
before, Your Highness.

213
00:11:03,420 --> 00:11:05,179
After this is settled,

214
00:11:05,860 --> 00:11:06,979
you must come back to
my mansion with me.

215
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:27,358
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

216
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:30,009
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

217
00:11:31,617 --> 00:11:34,061
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

218
00:11:34,455 --> 00:11:36,906
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

219
00:11:37,869 --> 00:11:40,808
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

220
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:43,940
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

221
00:11:44,619 --> 00:11:49,190
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

222
00:11:52,084 --> 00:11:54,440
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

223
00:11:55,140 --> 00:11:57,460
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

224
00:11:59,001 --> 00:12:01,565
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

225
00:12:02,008 --> 00:12:04,190
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

226
00:12:05,466 --> 00:12:08,301
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

227
00:12:08,841 --> 00:12:11,190
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

228
00:12:11,726 --> 00:12:13,053
♪This love remains unchanged♪

229
00:12:13,078 --> 00:12:16,190
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

230
00:12:18,195 --> 00:12:20,660
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

231
00:12:20,781 --> 00:12:24,760
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

232
00:12:25,138 --> 00:12:27,513
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

233
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:29,420
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

234
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:31,190
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

235
00:12:31,973 --> 00:12:34,566
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

236
00:12:34,591 --> 00:12:38,719
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

237
00:12:39,307 --> 00:12:41,276
♪I don't regret that vow♪

238
00:12:41,300 --> 00:12:44,731
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
